program EvidenceResolution
version 0.5
identity evidence_resolution
purpose "Resolve one unknown through explicitly named evidence."
claim "The cause unknown is resolved only through the declared test record."
risk medium
confidence 0.95
path O -> E -> U -> I -> G -> R -> P -> F -> Y

evidence cause_test "Controlled causal test result."
unknown cause protected required_for=decision
invariant resolution_rule "Unknowns resolve only through named evidence."
authority analyst scope=analysis "Analyst may resolve this bounded claim."
affected decision_subject
recovery correction "Reopen the claim if the evidence is invalidated."
effect MayAffect<decision_subject>
effect ResolvesUnknown<cause>
resolve cause with=cause_test
yield "Cause resolved within the scope of the declared test."
